# common_rtl — simulation output and tool artifacts are never versioned.
#
# Committed layout (everything else is generated and ignored):
#   <ip>/rtl/                   RTL sources (*.sv, *.v, *.svh, *.vh) and filelists (*.f)
#   <ip>/csr/                   CSR documents and register maps
#   <ip>/spec_original/         the specification sources the RTL was generated from
#   <ip>/verification/tb/       testbench sources (*.sv, *.v) and checkers
#   <ip>/verification/vectors/  hand-written test vectors (*.vec, *.txt)
#   <ip>/verification/*.py      cocotb / python testbench, *.mk Makefiles
#
# Everything produced by simulation, lint, synthesis, STA or the C++/Verilator
# build is ignored below, including waveform dumps and generated headers.

# --- whole-IP exclusions (deliberately not versioned) ----------------------
/012_CAN_Controller/

# --- simulation waveforms & sim data --------------------------------------
*.vcd
*.fst
*.fsdb
*.wlf
*.vpd
*.dat

# --- logs & reports --------------------------------------------------------
*.log
*.rpt
*.jou
*.str

# --- compiled simulation & coverage ---------------------------------------
*.vvp
*.exe
*.ucdb
*.vdb
*.cm

# --- Verilator / C++ build artifacts (all generated in this repo) ---------
# NOTE: no hand-written C++ lives here; if a DPI-C model is added, scope these
# to the build directories instead of a blanket rule.
*.cpp
*.h
*.o
*.a
*.d
*.gch
*.pch
*.rsp

# --- synthesis / STA / implementation output -------------------------------
*.sdf
*.spef
*.ddc
*.svf
*.dsn
*.edif
*.net

# --- Python cache ----------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- tool working / output directories -------------------------------------
build*/
obj*/
obj_dir/
coverage*/
logs*/
waveforms_sim/
mutation/
sanity_v2/
work/
sim/
tmp/
